  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-big-red-truck-v5-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "cce105aa2a26be0b06e12b495373a2817ef85bd997b1f7d6a12731a1aceac767",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "cd362876ac8cc5e01d5ce95c344668f813fbddafb358e82d39b2cbff88f44d8b",
      "text": "悟空和\n大红消防车",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "dcfa1bda05406cb94582968701aa07533aac9b6b6c97e094e9c5e4b87433ffbe",
      "text": "一辆大红车开过来。\n“看那些轮子！”\n悟空的尾巴“嘣”地翘起来！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "335b10c7380e38fab70052713c5fd7c55dca065586eacb08780b5272a684c70f",
      "text": "在消防站，本叔叔挥挥手。\n“快来看看吧！”\n悟空有好多问题想问。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5bf32c3bf1c90082460a194e8ffd604441bd615362e59ee884f2eebbce02e3a0",
      "text": "“为什么穿大靴子？”\n“大靴子能保护我的脚。”\n悟空看看自己的鞋：\n“我的只会吱吱响！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d83241e7a71603fe5f99adf40519778277c94ac2c56b6074844c96c852fdcfa0",
      "text": "本叔叔借他一顶玩具头盔。\n头盔滑下来，盖住了眉毛。\n“消防员需要眼睛吗？”\n“非常需要！”本叔叔笑了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "2d7a34fd3efe21aff69acfdd4b350da108bf3c49bea094f0e2d9c5fba187fd30",
      "text": "本叔叔拿出一个特别的面罩。\n“它帮我呼吸\n干净的空气。”\n声音一下子变了样！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b9060c2eced419c378278f5b42d45ad9d983c38ae4b983fcc7b899085b7228de",
      "text": "“还是我呀！”本叔叔说。\n悟空也挥挥手：\n“咦，本叔叔！\n你的声音变啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d4045343d1ec339e840912d593b6b0509c00af3cb8e97ed8b9c15b0bbf44dad5",
      "text": "“那是一根大面条吗？”\n“是水带！”本叔叔说，\n“用来把水送过去。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "49e3b67a4b732e7146dfa88b7bb15a84af1856bbccd848c0304340d741eaf76a",
      "text": "本叔叔握住水带。\n哗——水喷了出来。\n一颗小水珠亲了亲\n悟空的鼻子。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a630a1375dad8188442c1fe941acd970866fe2167e666bf1daa2407d45d915ab",
      "text": "“那梯子呢？”\n“它帮我们爬到高处。”\n悟空站在下面，\n尾巴往上伸。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "26df07b1ace0c1bb75a332cd0b8ea3c09ff8132e3de8c853561d9162a3c4b7b8",
      "text": "接着，本叔叔拿出报警器。\n“嘀！嘀！嘀！”\n“这是警报声，在提醒大家。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "78f27f51d6818ac9eb7a9d023a03d39a07e3581cf1bb95223a38a27bca7550ae",
      "text": "“听到警报，就到外面去。”\n他们练习怎么走出去。\n“到了外面，就待在那里。”\n本叔叔说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "7e9060cedd10d4829eb22f533e36064c926b1da06e98feb040b27f7c973e0ab5",
      "text": "他们约好在一棵树下集合。\n“数数鼻子！”悟空说。\n八戒把自己数了两遍。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "46c2ed269f4654526a82367bc1dbd867a3144a02c507d99c0d7ebc0046a12244",
      "text": "悟空谢谢本叔叔：\n“好大的消防车，\n好多重要的事，\n还有一颗热心肠！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9b8cd8f0f1daae683599780444a70a38bf5f40c25209600511497d65ae1f96ad",
      "text": "回到家，玩具车响起来：\n呜哇……呜哇……\n声音小了，\n又小了……嘘。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3515b83954211da2c7898f0cf88eb8c50ddf3923f299b5011b3fa5571e44f492",
      "text": "他给玩具车盖好被子。\n“晚安，小帮手们。”\n房间安静下来了，\n悟空也安静下来了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ec8d2925b34f65683b4ac3a96f4d0a62c5669ce90c16387e750248f64252ac20",
